title: "SelfCheckUltrasound: Image Quality-Aware Diagnosis and Reacquisition Guidance for Point-of-Care Echocardiography"
abstract: "A modular machine learning framework and closed-loop decision support simulator for point-of-care cardiac ultrasound. Connects continuous image quality assessment, out-of-fold task adequacy estimation, physics-informed acoustic fault diagnosis, and guarded probe reacquisition guidance."
